#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Mason's Software — the software centre for MasonOS.

A Discover replacement: it talks to whatever the distro ships (dnf5/dnf, apt,
pacman, yay/paru for the AUR, zypper) plus Flatpak, and installs and removes
through the normal system tools, escalating with pkexec only for the step that
needs root. The packaging work lives in ../lib/mason_software_backend.py.

    mason-software               open the store
    mason-software --page updates
    mason-software --screenshot out.png
"""

